data: {"id": "d496513908cb4799-thinking-parallel_evidence-1200", "run_id": "d496513908cb4799", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据总结\n\n### 已确认事实（支持）\n\n1. **Pod 真实状态为 Pending**（Kubernetes describe、YAML、Metrics 三处一致确认），app 容器状态为 Waiting/ContainerCreating。\n2. **根因事件明确**：Multus 持续发出 `NoNetworkFound` 警告，描述为 `Failed to create sandbox/network due to missing network-attachment-definition 'unavailable-network' in namespace 'aiops-case-05'`。\n3. **Pod YAML 确认配置**：注解 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network` 引用了不存在的网络附加定义。\n4. **Metrics 确认**：\n   - `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (Pending)\n   - `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_r", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788783663411, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

